[{"title":"龟堂独酌二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"一榼兰溪自献酬，徂年不肯为人留。\n巴山频入初寒梦，江月偏供独夜愁。\n越石壮心鸡喔喔，子卿归信雁悠悠。\n天生我辈初何用，病骨支离又过秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8544,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟堂晚兴","author":"陆游","text":"九日春阴一日晴，回塘闲院惬幽情。\n小鱼出水圆纹见，轻燕穿帘折势成。\n今日掩关真佚老，向来涉世亦遗名。\n巡檐更有欣然处，新笋初抽四五茎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8545,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟堂晨起","author":"陆游","text":"培火螭炉起宝熏，滴泉鏊研聚玄云。\n屏围燕几成山字，簟展凉轩作水纹。\n绝口不谈浮世事，洗心聊策退居勋。\n耄年犹健非无自，一卷丹经受郑君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟堂避暑","author":"陆游","text":"缥缈纱幮覆象床，蛮童擎粥进黄粱。\n砚池湛湛一泓墨，衣焙霏霏半篆香。\n团扇题诗无滞思，清泉洒地有馀凉。\n更须风伯开云阵，准拟今宵月满廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凭栏","author":"陆游","text":"蝉嘒晚尤壮，鸦栖久未安。\n不成浮舴艋，故作凭阑干。\n露重倾荷盖，风尖蹙芡盘。\n新秋动归思，更觉五湖宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到严十五晦朔郡酿不佳求于都下既不时至欲借书读之而寓公多秘不肯出无以度日殊惘惘也","author":"陆游","text":"桐君故隐两经秋，小院孤灯夜夜愁。\n名酒过于求赵璧，异书浑似借荆州。\n溪山胜处身难到，风月佳时事不休。\n安得连车载郫酿，金鞭重作浣花游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到家旬馀意味甚适戏书","author":"陆游","text":"天恐红尘著脚深，不教经岁去山林。\n欲酬清净三生愿，先洗功名万里心。\n石鼎飕飗闲煮茗，玉徽零落自修琴。\n晚来剩有华胥兴，卧看西窗一炷沉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧龙","author":"陆游","text":"危磴盘纡上翠微，倚天楼观碧参差。\n雨来海气先横骛，风恶松柯尽倒垂。\n孤鹘归巢翅翎重，断鸿觅伴语声悲。\n人间万事难禁老，醉抚阑干欲暮时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8551,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧疾","author":"陆游","text":"旧疾乘衰作，长贫与懒宜。\n羁愁惟付酒，史课未妨诗。\n雨入残更滴，霜逢闰岁迟。\n新春真耄及，不用卜归期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8552,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病书怀","author":"陆游","text":"衮衮年光挽不留，即今已白五分头。\n病中对酒犹思醉，梦里逢人亦说愁。\n青海战云临贼垒，黑山飞雪洒貂裘。\n丈夫有志终难料，憔悴渔村死即休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8553,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病杂题五首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"陋室施床迮，穷阎问疾疏。\n加餐惟是粥，弄笔不成书。\n盎盎新篘酒，青青小摘蔬。\n客来邀褫带，聊示小勤渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8554,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病杂题五首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"鸥鹭驯亭沼，琴书悦性灵。\n身叨乡祭酒，孙为国添丁。\n烟浦收菰菜，秋山斸茯苓。\n虚名吾所薄，未应少微星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病杂题五首 其五","author":"陆游","text":"人间跛男子，物外病维摩。\n但可妨趋拜，何因废啸歌。\n菜羹醯酱薄，村巷棘茨多。\n举手谢邻父，非君谁肯过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病杂题五首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"㕮咀初成药，咿哑半掩扉。\n病知身健乐，闲觉宦游非。\n小涧看猿饮，枯筇拥鹤归。\n今朝更堪喜，书札得淮淝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8557,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病杂题五首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"终日常辞客，经秋半在床。\n爱穷留作伴，谙病与相忘。\n灶婢工烹粥，园丁习写方。\n今朝有奇事，久雨得窗光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8558,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病累日羸甚偶复小健戏作三首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"病忽迨旬日，衰如增十年。\n难求秦缓药，空负宋清钱。\n微火秋先跨，闲房昼亦眠。\n偶赊书鬼录，遇酒又陶然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8559,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病累日羸甚偶复小健戏作三首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"行年当大耋，卧病涉高秋。\n丸药作奇验，俶装仍小留。\n轻沤元泛泛，破屋已飕飕。\n尚有江湖兴，沙头问钓舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8560,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病累日羸甚偶复小健戏作三首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"伏枕濒九死，下床如再生。\n幸回蒿里驾，犹作越吟声。\n拂几嗟尘积，开书觉眼明。\n淖糜方自养，未敢忆南烹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8561,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"受外祠敕","author":"陆游","text":"放浪江湖迹已陈，今朝剩喜结衔新。\n读骚未敢称名士，拜赐犹应号散人。\n归去还骑款段马，醉颠重岸接䍦巾。\n行行渐近云门寺，愈信人生有宿因。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8562,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呻吟","author":"陆游","text":"呻吟半岁掩柴扉，性命惟存气力微。\n夙业岂能逃马麦，穷居赖是惯牛衣。\n浊清且复分贤圣，今昨谁能论是非。\n一段光明君记取，要知无念是真归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8563,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张功父见寄二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"举世何人念此翁，敢期相问寂寥中。\n回思旧社惊年往，细读来书恨纸穷。\n我用荷锄为事业，君将高枕示神通。\n叮宁一语宜深听，信笔题诗勿太工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8564,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张功父见寄二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"佐命貂蝉再世孙，手锄瓜垄傍青门。\n超腾已得丹换骨，恋著肯求香返魂。\n正复悲秋如骑省，可令病渴似文园。\n庭前柏树西来意，握手何时得共论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8565,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范舍人书怀","author":"陆游","text":"岁月如奔不可遮，即今杨柳已藏鸦。\n客中常欠尊中酒，马上时看檐上花。\n末路凄凉老巴蜀，少年豪举动京华。\n天魔久矣先成佛，多病维摩尚在家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范舍人病后二诗末章兼呈张正字 其一","author":"陆游","text":"放衙元不为春酲，澹荡江天气未清。\n欲赏园花先梦到，忽闻檐雨定心惊。\n香云不动熏笼暖，蜡泪成堆斗帐明。\n关陇宿兵胡未灭，祝公垂意在尊生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范待制秋日书怀二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"闲窗贝叶对旁行，不觉城笳报夕阳。\n嗜酒步兵犹未达，拂衣司谏亦成忙。\n室无摩诘持花女，囊有婆娑等价香。\n欲与众生共安隐，秋来梦不到鲈乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范待制秋日书怀二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"故人无字寄相思，敢向穷途怨不知。\n老病已全惟欠死，贪嗔虽断尚馀痴。\n数茎雪鬓江湖远，九转金丹日月迟。\n畬粟山苗俱可饱，明年东去隐峨眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范待制秋兴三首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"睡脸馀痕印枕纹，秋衾微润覆炉熏。\n井桐摇落先霜尽，衣杵凄凉带月闻。\n佛屋纱灯明小像，经奁鱼蠹蚀真文。\n身如病骥惟思卧，谁许能空万马群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范待制秋兴三首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"山泽沉冥气尚豪，鬓丝未遽叹萧骚。\n已忘海运鲲鹏化，那计风微燕雀高。\n万里客魂迷楚峡，五更归梦隔胥涛。\n故知有酒当勤醉，自古宁闻死可逃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范待制秋兴三首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"策策桐飘已半空，啼螀渐觉近房栊。\n一生不作牛衣泣，万事从渠马耳风。\n名姓已甘黄纸外，光阴全付绿尊中。\n门前剥啄谁相觅，贺我今年号放翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8572,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"陆游","text":"夜雨灯前感概深，为邦一士重千金。\n风云未展康时略，天地能知许国心。\n剑忽拄颐都将相，帽曾压耳隐山林。\n英雄自古常如此，君看隆中梁甫吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8573,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜与儿子出门闲步","author":"陆游","text":"家住黄花入麦村，闲将稚子出柴门。\n草根萤堕久开阖，云际月行时吐吞。\n未分悲忧攻齿发，已将生死付乾坤。\n旧书半蠹犹堪读，粝饭藜羹莫更论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8574,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜与子遹说蜀道因作长句示之","author":"陆游","text":"忆自梁州入剑门，关山无处不消魂。\n亚松托宿逢秋雨，小柏经行听晓猿。\n当日只知悲客路，归来终亦老江村。\n吾儿生晚那知此，聊对青灯与细论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8575,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜大雨连明晨起乃知之","author":"陆游","text":"黄紬被稳枕慵移，夜雨淋浪了不知。\n水长坏陂初复后，鸠鸣去妇却还时。\n芳蹊入夏多青子，白发今年有黑丝。\n剩欲披衣湖上去，满村芳草正离离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8576,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜中步月","author":"陆游","text":"夜半不成寐，起寻微月行。\n风生惊叶堕，露重觉荷倾。\n兀兀酒中趣，悠悠身后名。\n兴阑还掩户，坐待日东生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8577,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜中独步","author":"陆游","text":"春半寒初退，更阑睡不成。\n褰裳偶独起，曳履得徐行。\n月上鸟未宿，水深蛙乱鸣。\n踟蹰忽已久，残漏下高城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8578,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜中独步庭下","author":"陆游","text":"山月明如昼，江风冷似秋。\n衰迟亦可叹，幽独自成愁。\n斗柄垂江渚，笳声下戍楼。\n我惟诗思在，从此亦宜休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8579,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜分不寐起坐园中至旦","author":"陆游","text":"凉气苏衰疾，幽情入杖藜。\n月惊孤鹊起，天带众星西。\n松菊今彭泽，山川古会稽。\n清吟殊未惬，喔喔已晨鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8580,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜分复起读书","author":"陆游","text":"愁极不成寐，起开窗下书。\n似囚逢纵释，如痒得爬梳。\n灯火夜过半，风霜岁欲除。\n平生济时意，却作爱吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8581,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜分读书有感","author":"陆游","text":"光阴百岁已中分，拟结茅茨老白云。\n万里谁怜新卧疾，九重犹记旧能文。\n枕边得句题屏叠，马上看山隔帽裙。\n终恨无劳縻廪粟，夜窗聊策读书勋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜半池上作","author":"陆游","text":"夜永空斋睡不成，起扶藤杖傍池行。\n露浓双鹊移枝宿，风急孤萤堕草明。\n断续更筹传古戍，纵横河汉接高城。\n寒泉未漱神先爽，静听铜瓶汲井声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜半读书罢出门徙倚久之归赋长句","author":"陆游","text":"浩歌曳杖出柴扉，不管三更露湿衣。\n拟看林梢残月上，偶逢浦口断云归。\n惊鸿脱网寒相倚，饥鹘思巢夜亦飞。\n却掩北窗谁晤语，聊凭香盌洗尘鞿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜四鼓睡觉起行檐间观新作南篱","author":"陆游","text":"星斗阑干天宇清，起披短褐绕廊行。\n叶声飒飒飞霜重，篱影疏疏落月明。\n沙冷断鸿投别浦，风高残漏下孤城。\n衰迟自笑情犹在，一首新诗取次成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"陆游","text":"野店晡炊饭，溪桥夜据鞍。\n天回河络角，海阔斗阑干。\n牧舍牛生犊，蔬园犬逐獾。\n今年时序早，九月已清寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"陆游","text":"城角传三弄，桑村喜独归。\n雨多萤满野，径狭露沾衣。\n食俭盐醯薄，年衰气力微。\n青灯对儿女，抚事一歔欷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜归舟中作","author":"陆游","text":"意薄杨修唤小儿，孤舟自笑发成丝。\n放开痴腹无非梦，拈起幽怀总是诗。\n霜下忽惊桐叶尽，滩生更觉水声奇。\n馀年那恨驱黄犊，除却为农百不宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8588,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"陆游","text":"鹤瘦龟饥与静宜，更阑徙倚并清池。\n月当三五初盈夜，河直西南欲落时。\n浩浩醉歌群鹜起，翩翩孤影角巾攲。\n飞仙授我青瑶简，索赋山中夜兴诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8589,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"陆游","text":"鬓毛饱受雪霜侵，一褐萧条寄故林。\n檐雨滴回羁枕梦，城笳唤起塞垣心。\n平生耻露囊中颖，垂老甘同爨下琴。\n灯烬欲残看瘦影，不妨袖手坐愔愔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8590,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"陆游","text":"穷巷行人绝，高城漏鼓稀。\n剧谈频剪烛，久坐旋更衣。\n饥鼠冲人过，啼鸦冒夜飞。\n客归吾未睡，孤影自相依。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8591,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"陆游","text":"夜出茆堂自撤扃，乌藤与我两伶俜。\n凉蟾吐晕围千丈，老木移阴可一庭。\n隔浦呼呜闻宿鸟，傍檐开阖数流萤。\n放翁尚友论千载，不取梁鸿即管宁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8592,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"陆游","text":"脱冠残发冷飕飗，北斗阑干河汉秋。\n木末有风栖鹊起，亭皋无月乱萤流。\n酒悭仅得时时醉，诗退难禁夜夜愁。\n欲睡不妨还小立，一声菱唱起沧洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8593,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜行","author":"陆游","text":"路长忧炬尽，马弱畏泥深。\n肠断猿啼树，魂惊鬼啸林。\n艰危穷自惯，寒苦老难禁。\n回首金牛道，加鞭负壮心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8594,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜行玉笥樵风之间宿龙瑞","author":"陆游","text":"野店溪桥供晚饷，吟边醉里弄春风。\n马行缺月黄昏后，钟下乱山空翠中。\n名宦不辞成寂寂，岁时惟恨去匆匆。\n颇闻禹穴遗书在，安得高人与细穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8595,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜行至白鹿泉上","author":"陆游","text":"小雨病良已，新秋夜渐长。\n隔城闻鹤唳，出户逐萤光。\n荒径穿蒙密，遥空望莽苍。\n泉声落环佩，肝肺为清凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8596,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"药裹关心处，篝灯照影时。\n文书用遮眼，枣栗可无饥。\n素业存农圃，颓龄迫耄期。\n盖棺万事已，唯负国恩私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8597,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"流落知闻绝，归休宠辱空。\n酒狂宁限老，诗思正须穷。\n活火生新焰，残灯委碎红。\n平生会心处，正在兀然中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8598,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"万蚁披书卷，孤萤引篆香。\n病思无事乐，老悔少年狂。\n南渡衣冠盛，西征道路长。\n如今俱梦破，高枕看人忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8599,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"老眼清无寐，孤怀默自伤。\n思人交旧尽，抚事岁时长。\n篱犬吠残月，江枫凋早霜。\n放翁殊耐事，掩卷拨炉香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8600,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"叶尽木无声，天高夜自明。\n映窗灯半灭，掠野雁孤征。\n瓦裂人间事，云浮身后名。\n惟应托长镵，寂寞送浮生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8601,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"蓬窗夜半竹骚然，坐守残编悄不眠。\n辛苦空成左传癖，逍遥常愧大慈仙。\n风宁可系功名误，日不能黏岁月迁。\n明旦觅船湖上去，西村桃李淡春烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8602,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"天公似欲假馀龄，针石年来幸小停。\n微火暖炉娱独夜，断云吐月缟中庭。\n眼前乐事寒醅绿，身后虚名蠹简青。\n赖有古人同此志，傍观不用叹伶仃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8603,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"饼饵支遥夜，薪烝禦早寒。\n卧闻风浩荡，起视斗阑干。\n鸡怯飞霜重，鸦惊出月残。\n挑灯搔短发，顾影发吾叹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8604,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"杳杳霜钟十里声，娟娟江月半窗明。\n陈编欲绝犹堪读，微火相依更有情。\n九曲烟云新散吏，百年铅椠老诸生。\n颓然待旦君无笑，尚胜闻鸡赋早行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8605,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"虚堂夜无寐，顾影叹竛竮。\n露湿萤黏草，云迷雁落汀。\n旧书开蠹简，浊酒倒残瓶。\n流落知无憾，危机实饱经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8606,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"山城意象自萧然，况是高斋作雪天。\n渐暗玉虫寒有烬，欲残金鸭暖无烟。\n衰容病后如添岁，遥夜冬来抵过年。\n安得龙绡三丈幅，为君试写白云篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8607,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"瘦骨倚蒲团，灯前影自看。\n心清便独夜，酒尽怯新寒。\n病虎减精采，饥鸿摧羽翰。\n晚途堪笑闵，犹拟乞祠官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8608,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陆游","text":"耿耿残灯夜未央，负墙闲对篆盘香。\n风号东北河冰合，月落西南竹影长。\n孤鹊欲栖频绕树，寒龟无息稳支床。\n颓然坐睡那知晓，推户朝曦已满廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8609,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐小饮","author":"陆游","text":"零落槐花已满沟，江湖又见一番秋。\n冰轮有辙凌空上，银汉无声接地流。\n丹荔甘寒劳远致，玉醅醇冽喜新篘。\n移床坐对西南电，好雨心知不待求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":8610,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]